  {
   "id": "al",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 108,
   "width": 351,
   "height": 21,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100004,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700028,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why 'load 10 GB and run A*' fails",
   "originalText": "Why 'load 10 GB and run A*' fails",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "an",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 146,
   "width": 1027,
   "height": 48,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100005,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700035,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Dijkstra and A* expand nodes outward from the origin, and for a 600 km route that frontier can grow to MILLIONS of nodes. Every\nexpansion is a pointer-chase into a 10 GB structure, so essentially every one is a cache miss - ~100 ns - and millions of them\nis seconds of pure memory-latency stall before any real work happens.",
   "originalText": "Dijkstra and A* expand nodes outward from the origin, and for a 600 km route that frontier can grow to MILLIONS of nodes. Every\nexpansion is a pointer-chase into a 10 GB structure, so essentially every one is a cache miss - ~100 ns - and millions of them\nis seconds of pure memory-latency stall before any real work happens.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "an2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 220,
   "width": 1011,
   "height": 48,
   "strokeColor": "#b91c1c",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100006,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700042,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "And it scales in the wrong direction: A*'s heuristic biases the frontier toward the destination, which helps, but on a long\nroute the frontier still sweeps an enormous region - every minor residential street in every town between here and there gets\nconsidered, to produce a route that uses NONE of them.",
   "originalText": "And it scales in the wrong direction: A*'s heuristic biases the frontier toward the destination, which helps, but on a long\nroute the frontier still sweeps an enormous region - every minor residential street in every town between here and there gets\nconsidered, to produce a route that uses NONE of them.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
