   }
  },
  {
   "id": "pipe_t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 38,
   "y": 1218,
   "width": 884,
   "height": 165,
   "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100052,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700364,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "GET /v1/nav?origin=...&destination=...&mode=driving&avoid=tolls\n\n1. geocoding          '1355 Market St, SF' -> (37.7767, -122.4166)\n                      -> derive the endpoint routing tiles from geohashes\n2. route planner      decides which detail levels this distance needs\n3. shortest path      A* across routing tiles, stitching neighbours\n                      -> 2-3 CANDIDATE routes, not one\n4. ETA service        per-segment time from live + historical traffic (ML)\n                      -> re-weights and re-scores the candidates\n5. ranker             applies user filters, then orders by duration\n6. encode             polyline + turn-by-turn instructions",
   "originalText": "GET /v1/nav?origin=...&destination=...&mode=driving&avoid=tolls\n\n1. geocoding          '1355 Market St, SF' -> (37.7767, -122.4166)\n                      -> derive the endpoint routing tiles from geohashes\n2. route planner      decides which detail levels this distance needs\n3. shortest path      A* across routing tiles, stitching neighbours\n                      -> 2-3 CANDIDATE routes, not one\n4. ETA service        per-segment time from live + historical traffic (ML)\n                      -> re-weights and re-scores the candidates\n5. ranker             applies user filters, then orders by duration\n6. encode             polyline + turn-by-turn instructions",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "pipe",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "dn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 1216,
   "width": 599,
   "height": 90,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100053,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700371,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "CANDIDATES ARE GENERATED BEFORE ETA IS APPLIED. The pathfinder works on a cheap\napproximate cost (distance / speed limit) to produce a few plausible routes, and\nonly then does the expensive ML-based ETA get applied to those few. Applying the\nmodel INSIDE the search would mean an inference call per edge expansion -\nmillions of them. Generating candidates cheaply and scoring them expensively is\nthe standard shape for any expensive-ranking problem.",
   "originalText": "CANDIDATES ARE GENERATED BEFORE ETA IS APPLIED. The pathfinder works on a cheap\napproximate cost (distance / speed limit) to produce a few plausible routes, and\nonly then does the expensive ML-based ETA get applied to those few. Applying the\nmodel INSIDE the search would mean an inference call per edge expansion -\nmillions of them. Generating candidates cheaply and scoring them expensively is\nthe standard shape for any expensive-ranking problem.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "dn2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 1330,
   "width": 606,
   "height": 75,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100054,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700378,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "FILTERS ARE APPLIED AT RANKING, NOT DURING SEARCH. 'Avoid tolls' COULD prune the\ngraph during search, which would be more efficient - but it would mean a separate\nsearch per filter combination, and it would return NOTHING when a filter makes\nthe destination unreachable. Ranking-time filtering degrades gracefully: 'no\ntoll-free route exists; here is the best one with tolls.'",
   "originalText": "FILTERS ARE APPLIED AT RANKING, NOT DURING SEARCH. 'Avoid tolls' COULD prune the\ngraph during search, which would be more efficient - but it would mean a separate\nsearch per filter combination, and it would return NOTHING when a filter makes\nthe destination unreachable. Ranking-time filtering degrades gracefully: 'no\ntoll-free route exists; here is the best one with tolls.'",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d5",
